1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
♪ [upbeat swung jazz-folk] ♪

2
00:00:04,733 --> 00:00:08,900
Hi, grown-ups! Today we're learning how an
opt-out works.

3
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:12,367
Say hello to Little Switch!

4
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:17,567
SWITCH: Hi! I've got two sides: on, and
off!

5
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:23,800
♪ You typed a little question in a little
search box line, ♪

6
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:27,433
♪ And an answer hopped on top of it and
said, "I'll save you time!" ♪

7
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:30,733
SWITCH: ♪ Yes, but can I please read the
page myself? ♪

8
00:00:30,967 --> 00:00:34,500
♪ Well, there's a tiny tab marked "Web,"
way up on the highest shelf! ♪

9
00:00:35,067 --> 00:00:38,167
SWITCH: ♪ I've only got two sides, it
isn't much to learn: ♪

10
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:41,767
SWITCH: ♪ You push me down for off...
[click] ...so how'd I just return? ♪

11
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,267
♪ Default on! Default on! ♪

12
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,033
♪ It was there when you woke up, it'll be
there when you're gone! ♪

13
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:52,433
♪ You can hide it, you can mute it, you
can tuck it out of view, ♪

14
00:00:52,633 --> 00:00:55,933
♪ But the switch is just a picture that
somebody drew for you. ♪

15
00:00:56,167 --> 00:00:59,800
SWITCH: ♪ Default on, on, on, on, on, on,
on... ♪

16
00:00:56,233 --> 00:00:57,233
♪ Default on! ♪

17
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,300
♪ [flute and scat] ♪

18
00:01:03,433 --> 00:01:09,467
♪ Now, "opt-in" means somebody asks you,
and you say, "Well, sure, why not." ♪

19
00:01:11,167 --> 00:01:16,867
SWITCH: ♪ And "opt-out" means that no one asked
you, and you're hunting for the spot! ♪

20
00:01:17,967 --> 00:01:21,367
♪ And "default" is the setting that they
picked before you came, ♪

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,933
♪ And if you never touch it, friend,
they'll say you picked the same. ♪

22
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:28,767
Got that? Opt-in, opt-out, default.
There'll be a test.

23
00:01:30,067 --> 00:01:31,367
SWITCH: There's always a test.

24
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:35,733
♪ Now your inbox got a helper, and it
wants to help you too! ♪

25
00:01:36,433 --> 00:01:39,367
♪ A lawsuit says it flipped itself last
fall, while out of view. ♪

26
00:01:39,933 --> 00:01:41,333
SWITCH: ♪ And what's the company say? ♪

27
00:01:41,633 --> 00:01:43,100
♪ That they didn't, and here's the door: ♪

28
00:01:43,433 --> 00:01:46,667
♪ Just a menu, then a menu, then a menu,
then one more! ♪

29
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:50,033
♪ Then the TV got an update in the middle
of the night, ♪

30
00:01:50,567 --> 00:01:53,533
♪ And a brand-new tile was waiting in the
early morning light! ♪

31
00:01:54,033 --> 00:01:55,067
SWITCH: ♪ Can I delete it? ♪

32
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:56,300
♪ You can hide it! ♪

33
00:01:56,767 --> 00:01:57,767
SWITCH: ♪ Is that the same? ♪

34
00:01:59,067 --> 00:02:00,067
♪ ...Next verse! ♪

35
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:04,833
SWITCH: ♪ I've only got two sides, it
isn't much to learn: ♪

36
00:02:05,233 --> 00:02:08,367
SWITCH: ♪ You push me down for off...
[click] ...so how'd I just return? ♪

37
00:02:09,033 --> 00:02:11,900
♪ Default on! Default on! ♪

38
00:02:12,067 --> 00:02:15,633
♪ It was there when you woke up, it'll be
there when you're gone! ♪

39
00:02:15,667 --> 00:02:19,067
♪ You can hide it, you can mute it, you
can tuck it out of view, ♪

40
00:02:19,233 --> 00:02:22,567
♪ But the switch is just a picture that
somebody drew for you. ♪

41
00:02:22,833 --> 00:02:23,700
♪ Default on! ♪

42
00:02:23,467 --> 00:02:26,067
SWITCH: ♪ On, on, on, on, on... ♪

43
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,200
Pop quiz!

44
00:02:30,067 --> 00:02:33,067
♪ There's a blue ring in the chat app
where you talk to Mom and Dad. ♪

45
00:02:33,133 --> 00:02:34,133
SWITCH: ♪ I'll uninstall it! ♪

46
00:02:34,192 --> 00:02:35,692
[wrong-answer horn]

47
00:02:34,567 --> 00:02:35,567
♪ Nope! ♪

48
00:02:35,633 --> 00:02:36,467
SWITCH: ♪ I'll mute it, then? ♪

49
00:02:36,467 --> 00:02:37,467
♪ That's not so bad! ♪

50
00:02:37,667 --> 00:02:40,633
♪ Now your phone has got an update, and it
asks you to "Continue." ♪

51
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:41,700
SWITCH: ♪ Where's the "No"? ♪

52
00:02:41,867 --> 00:02:44,067
♪ There isn't one! It turned back on for
you! ♪

53
00:02:44,933 --> 00:02:47,933
♪ In Australia, office software went up
forty-five percent... ♪

54
00:02:48,333 --> 00:02:49,867
SWITCH: ♪ Was there one without the robot?
♪

55
00:02:50,167 --> 00:02:51,767
♪ Only once you tried to leave! ♪

56
00:02:51,664 --> 00:02:53,164
[door slams]

57
00:02:51,867 --> 00:02:55,200
♪ Now the school's the place for learning,
and the school picks what you learn, ♪

58
00:02:55,633 --> 00:02:58,833
♪ So the school said, "No AI, please," and
waited for its turn. ♪

59
00:02:59,233 --> 00:03:02,367
♪ And the giant said, "We hear you! Here's
a deal that's very fair: ♪

60
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:06,433
♪ Take the robot with your search, or else
there's no search there!" ♪

61
00:03:05,912 --> 00:03:07,412
[crowd boos]

62
00:03:08,412 --> 00:03:09,912
[record scratch, tape rewinds]

63
00:03:09,267 --> 00:03:12,967
♪ Correction, boys and girls! You can
switch the chatbot off, ♪

64
00:03:13,667 --> 00:03:15,400
♪ And you keep your search and everything!
♪

65
00:03:15,533 --> 00:03:16,900
SWITCH: ♪ And the answer box on top? ♪

66
00:03:17,867 --> 00:03:19,433
♪ ...That one's "deeply integrated." ♪

67
00:03:19,767 --> 00:03:20,767
SWITCH: ♪ What's that mean? ♪

68
00:03:21,467 --> 00:03:22,467
♪ It means it stays. ♪

69
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,967
♪ Default on! Default on! ♪

70
00:03:26,067 --> 00:03:29,567
♪ It was there when we woke up, it'll be
there when we're gone! ♪

71
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:32,767
♪ We can hide it, we can mute it, we can
tuck it out of view, ♪

72
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:36,767
♪ But the switch is just a picture that
somebody drew for you! ♪

73
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,400
♪ Default on! ♪

74
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:42,767
SWITCH: ♪ I've got two sides. [click]
[click] [click] ♪

75
00:03:44,967 --> 00:03:46,700
SWITCH: ♪ ...Guess one of 'em was just for
show. ♪

76
00:03:48,433 --> 00:03:52,867
And that's how an opt-out works! Join us
next week, when we learn about...

77
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,820
[pop-up chime]

78
00:03:55,767 --> 00:03:56,767
Who asked for that?

79
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,233
SWITCH: Hey, who wrote this song, anyway?

80
00:04:01,067 --> 00:04:04,500
An AI did. ...But somebody asked it to.

81
00:04:04,867 --> 00:04:06,467
SWITCH: Hey... was its switch on, too?

82
00:04:11,303 --> 00:04:12,803
[light switch clicks off]
